ng metrics, logs, and traces into one place. [...] Grafana Faro: Grafana Faro is an open source JavaScript agent that embeds in web applications to collect real user monitoring (RUM) data: performance metrics, logs, exceptions, events, and traces. For more information about using Grafana Faro, refer to Grafana Faro documentation. [...] Grafana Pyroscope: Grafana Pyroscope is an open source software project for aggregating continuous profiling data. Continuous profiling is an observability signal that allows you to understand your workload’s resources (CPU, memory, for example) usage down to the line number. For more information about Grafana Pyroscope, refer to Grafana Pyroscope documentation.'}}

